# Eval run artefacts (markdown + per-run JSON, written by scripts/run-evals.ts).
# Nothing at runtime reads them — the cron reads evals/cases and evals/suite.json,
# and history lives in Supabase. Uploading them would bloat every deploy.
evals/reports/
